      "filename": "View over the Town from the Road into Town - Ouro Preto - Minas Gerais - Brazil.jpg",
      "title": "File:View over the Town from the Road into Town - Ouro Preto - Minas Gerais - Brazil.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/View_over_the_Town_from_the_Road_into_Town_-_Ouro_Preto_-_Minas_Gerais_-_Brazil.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
